---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import portrait from "../assets/about/dan.png";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Dan Pearce, game designer with 12+ years across mobile, console, and PC."
>
  <section class="container about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>I design games that respect the player's time.</h1>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="bio">
        <p>
          Hello there. I'm glad you've taken the time to check out my page. I've
          been a passionate gamer since the days of the Super Nintendo, and am
          constantly engrossing myself in video games and the culture they
          create. I love games that are challenging and unique, captivating me
          with their narrative and world design.
        </p>
        <p>
          It's not all about computer games though. I also love music, and
          particularly the sounds of Blues and Rock. Pink Floyd and Eric Clapton
          being stand outs. As a Welshman I'm an inherent supporter of our
          National Rugby Team and an inherent supporter of beers, lagers and
          fine ales.
        </p>

        <h2>What I'm good at</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Systems design, economy, progression, combat</li>
          <li>Live-ops design and balancing</li>
          <li>FTUE and player onboarding</li>
          <li>Narrative integration with mechanics</li>
          <li>Cross-discipline collaboration with engineering & art</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="aside">
        <div class="portrait">
          <Image src={portrait} alt="Dan Pearce" widths={[200, 320, 480]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 200px, 320px" />
        </div>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt>Based</dt><dd>UK</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Currently</dt><dd>Senior Live Ops Designer, Spectarium</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Open to</dt><dd>Senior / Lead design roles</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="btn" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: 3rem;
    max-width: 980px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .bio h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .bio ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bio li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .aside {
    position: sticky;
    top: 5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .portrait {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .portrait :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .facts {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .facts div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .facts dt {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .facts dd {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .aside {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
